969	+# SMA-819 Anthropic empty text block Implementation Plan
970	+
971	+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
972	+
973	+**Goal:** The Anthropic translator never sends a blank text block, never sends an empty message, keeps `tool_use`/`tool_result` in item order, and fails early when the drops leave no valid request.
974	+
975	+**Architecture:** All translation changes are in `translate/request.rs` (`translate_messages`, `user_blocks`, `assistant_blocks`). `translate_messages` reports one new flag on `TranslatedMessages`. `build_body` in `translate/mod.rs` turns that flag and an empty `messages` array into `ModelError::Other`.
976	+
977	+**Tech Stack:** Rust, `serde_json::Value`, `wiremock` (wire tests), `tokio` (live tests).
978	+
979	+**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-20-sma-819-anthropic-empty-text-block-design.md`
980	+
981	+## Global Constraints
982	+
983	+- Crate: `crates/paigasus-helikon-providers-anthropic`. Do not change `paigasus-helikon-core` or any other provider.
984	+- "Blank" means `text.trim().is_empty()` (Rust `str::trim`).
985	+- A kept text block keeps its exact text. Never trim the text that is sent.
986	+- Never put placeholder text in place of a dropped block.
987	+- A `tracing` line about a drop may contain counts only, never text.
988	+- No hand version bump. Commit type `fix(providers-anthropic)` for code, `test(providers-anthropic)` for tests only, `docs(plan)` / `docs(spec)` for docs. Prefix the subject with `SMA-819`.
989	+- Before each commit: `cargo fmt --all` and `cargo clippy -p paigasus-helikon-providers-anthropic --all-targets -- -D warnings`.
990	+- Work synchronously in the foreground. Do not end your turn while a cargo command runs. Do not run `git checkout`, `git switch`, `git reset`, `git stash` or any command that moves HEAD or changes branches.
991	+- Work only in `/Users/smaschek/dev/paigasus/paigasus-helikon/.claude/worktrees/sma-819`. Use absolute paths under that root for every file edit.
992	+
993	+## Review Focus
994	+
995	+1. A request that ends in a blank user message after a tool result (the SMA-804 `Inject([Text ""])` path) must send the `tool_result` blocks and must not fail. Covered in Task 2 and Task 3.
996	+2. A caller-made prefill (the last item is an `AssistantMessage`) must not get the decision-(c) error, even if an earlier user message was blank. Covered in Task 3.
997	+3. Many tool loops in one history (call, result, call, result, text) must keep strict alternation. Covered in Task 1 (`multi_round_tool_loop_without_assistant_text_alternates`).
998	+4. A reasoning-only assistant turn before tool calls (a session recorded with thinking on) must translate exactly as a tool-only turn. Covered in Task 2.
999	+5. `CacheStrategy::LastTurn` must not put `cache_control` on a dropped block. Covered in Task 3.
